      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that, i really do. but it doesn't change the math of it. they had so much more life left in them. i'm just... barely getting by, and it feels like i'm just consuming resources and love that should have gone to them. it feels selfish to even want to feel better, u know? like i'm just stealing time.",
