      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The world doesn't need \"balance\" dictated by who lives or who doesn't; it just needs to be. You are not a debt, but a living, breathing person whose presence is inherently significant. Those thoughts of things being \"more sensible\" are the noise of grief, not the truth of your reality.",
      "source": "target",
